<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37128" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξενᾰρίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>strip</i> or <i>spoil</i> a foe slain in fight, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					4.488
				</span></i>
			, etc.; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεύχεα ἐ.</span>
			<i>strip off</i> his arms, <i><span class="en">
				13.619
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>kill, slay,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				11.273
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγχεϊ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					6.30
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				289
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				B.
				5.146
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				50
			</span></i>, etc.—In <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> more freq. than the simple Verb.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
